      "headline": "Deloitte | Wipro Ltd. | MDI Gurgaon PGDM 2021-2023 | Ex-Reliance Industries Ltd. | Nirma University, Ahmedabad",
      "about": "Anmol is a bootstrapper who thrives in a difficult and dynamic atmosphere, likes developing new business strategies, and succeeds at delivering client wins using an insight-driven approach. He has worked in Operations, IT and interned in a sales role, showing that he more than adaptable to different roles and environments.\n\nAnmol has completed his MBA in Sales & Marketing and Operations from MDI Gurgaon in 2023 and has been working as a consultant with Wipro. Here he has been given the opportunity to work with American clients and work on their respective RFPs and he has been able to successfully convert multiple deals for long term managed IT services.\n\nAnmol also had the opportunity to intern with Asian Paints in their retail sales department in Ahmedabad and was able to work at the grassroot level which helped him understand the market sentiment and devise sales strategy for multiple zones.\n\nHis interest in Automation led him to earn a bachelor's degree in Instrumentation and Control and then look for jobs that required him to work on a variety of abilities.\n\nIn his stint at Reliance Industries Limited (Vadodara Manufacturing Division), Anmol worked with strict deadlines and managed contractor manpower, while dealing with the vendor and non-supervisory staff network. The job role made Anmol approach problems not only as an engineer, but as a team leader as well while leading CAPEX projects, like commissioning of a new Fire & Gas Safety system at the site which drastically reduced the response time to such incidents and increased Safety of the site.",
